  "summary": "Malicious code in farplotzy (npm)",
  "details": "The package ships opaque native executables (a Go binary and a Bun-compiled binary) alongside a thin React wrapper. The Linux Go binary contains a hardcoded network endpoint catcher1[.]corraldev[.]com:8084. The package's declared bin entry points to bin/cli.js, which is not present in the tarball; the actual executables are native binaries whose behaviour is not visible in the source. The React wrapper posts plot data to api[.]farplotzy[.]dev/v1/render with a Bearer token.",
